  "id": "tyrande",
  "name": "Tyrande",
  "role": "Healer",
  "overview": "Tyrande is a ranged Healer that offers an exceptional amount of utility. She is capable of providing vision for the rest of her team, healing wounded teammates, and disrupting enemy Heroes by Stunning and Slowing them. Tyrande is a very versatile Hero which allows her to adapt to the course of the game very well. Her strong crowd control and her ability to keep track of the enemy team's movements make up for her low Health pool and lack of mobility.",
  "strengths": [
    "Sentinel is a useful scouting Ability",
    "Lunar Flare works incredibly well with other crowd control Abilities",
    "Hunter's Mark significantly increases her team's damage when focusing on a single enemy target",
    "Great single target healing",
    "Access to a low-cooldown cleanse effect at Level 16",
    "Is the only hero that can reliably increase Basic Attack Damage of allies"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "Lacks any form of escape ability",
    "Bad waveclear",
    "High learning curve",
    "Requires a lot of map awareness",
    "very susceptible to dives"
  ],
