    "explanation": "Tyrande synergizes very well with Tanks like Diablo, E.T.C., or Varian, whose initiation Abilities lay a perfect foundation for Lunar Flare's Stun effect. Burst-oriented Assassins can easily capitalize on Hunter's Mark Armor Reduction, while Basic Attack-heavy Heroes benefit from Trueshot Aura's 40% damage increase for 5 seconds."
